to\">\n<li>Download this module with</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"composer config repositories.web-installer vcs https://github.com/mage-os-lab/web-installer\ncomposer require --dev mage-os/web-installer dev-main\"><pre>composer config repositories.web-installer vcs https://github.com/mage-os-lab/web-installer\ncomposer require --dev mage-os/web-installer dev-main</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"3\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Open your browser to your virtual host name and you should get redirected to <code>/setup</code></li>\n</ol>\n</article></div>"
